["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"OpenAI’s Head of Design: This is the best time in history to be a designer | Ian Silber blank box problem capability overhang building in public systems thinking\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-16-lennys-设计师不是被-ai-取代-是终于被放大了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2bbdf8e3b6682214-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0816</span></div>\n<h2>设计师不是被 AI 取代，是终于被放大了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">调查显示设计师是全 tech 最不开心的群体，但 OpenAI 设计负责人认为这是历史上做设计师最好的时候——因为没人有标准答案，今天开始的人反而有优势。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">产品设计</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 工具</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1349: Smallpox and mummies liquid-liquid phase separation (LLPS) intrinsically disordered region (IDR) biomolecular condensate RNA polymerase holoenzyme vaccinia virus factory synonymous substitution rate\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-16-twiv-反疫苗古已有之-噬菌体凝聚体是转录调控核心/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">T</div><span class=\"dur\">2:03:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0816</span></div>\n<h2>反疫苗不是新现象：珍纳原著里就写满了骂他的话</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">本期揭示反疫苗运动与疫苗一样古老；噬菌体SPO1通过液-液相分离凝聚体完成转录时相转换；南美天花古DNA证实欧洲殖民传播；阅读衰退与AI生成内容威胁辨别力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">噬菌体</span><span class=\"tag\">疫苗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"How Slavery Built the Roman Empire manumission verna servus poenae dispensator freedmen Pax Romana\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-16-ancients-罗马帝国是奴隶制的产物-无奴隶则无帝国/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7ffc0e03b96daabb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0816</span></div>\n<h2>罗马帝国不是靠军团，是靠被奴役者撑起来的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">罗马的行政、军队、家务、工坊到矿场几乎全靠被奴役者运转；公元前146年迦太基陷落后奴隶制成为经济引擎，奥古斯都停止扩张后靠生育自我复制。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">罗马史</span><span class=\"tag\">奴隶制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The Hidden Risk in the US-Japan Yen Rescue carry trade forward premium puzzle Cakeism Treasury Convenience Yield\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-15-patrickboyle-美国救日元不是为日本-是为自家万亿美债/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2eb71149af422d0e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">31:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Patrick Boyle</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0815</span></div>\n<h2>美国救日元不是为日本，是为自家万亿美债</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国28年来首次干预日元，官方说是帮盟友；真正的算盘是防止日本为保汇率抛售1万亿美元美债——那会推高美国自己的举债成本。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美债</span><span class=\"tag\">日元</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Episode 128: Early Sufism tasawwuf fana antinomianism mihna al-Malamatiyya\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-15-litandhist-苏菲主义不是低配版伊斯兰-是哈里发国的反弹/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ae099525368458ba-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:56:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">文学与历史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0815</span></div>\n<h2>苏菲主义不是低配版伊斯兰，是哈里发国的反弹</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">欧洲东方学家把苏菲主义说成横跨欧亚的神秘主义，现代西方推广者称它是「爱、和谐与美」的讯息——但它的根是彻底伊斯兰的，与最初几个哈里发国的文化史不可分割。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">伊斯兰教</span><span class=\"tag\">苏菲主义</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"The Skeptics Guide #1101 - Aug 15 2026 BFI (beamforming feedback information) LUCA (last universal common ancestor) Balmer break CSA (community supported agriculture)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-15-skeptics-wi-fi-信号能认出你-而且不用你带手机/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cc4dc31b3b84e70d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:54:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Skeptics Guide</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0815</span></div>\n<h2>Wi-Fi 信号能认出你，而且不用你带手机</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Wi-Fi 5 起设备回传的 BFI 是明文，谁在射频范围内架个接收器就能读到；靠人体扰动信号识别个人，实验准确率最高 99.5%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">隐私安全</span><span class=\"tag\">疫苗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1348: Clinical update with Dr. Daniel Griffin MMR ACIP lyophilized PICO sterile insect technique RIG\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-15-twiv-行政令里的谎言-拆mmr与汽水比喻都是伪科学/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">T</div><span class=\"dur\">55:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0815</span></div>\n<h2>行政令称疫苗如汽水，拆MMR增针数：每句都是谎言</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">「金标准」行政令里每句话都被称为谎言：拆开MMR增加针数、疫苗如汽水、Merck拒绝，CDC新局长将面临站队。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">疫苗政策</span><span class=\"tag\">MMR</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Ep 265: David Deutsch&#x27;s &quot;The Fabric of Reality&quot; Chapter 14 &quot;The Ends of the Universe&quot; Part 2 The Omega Point omega point Church principle Kardashev scale unitarity CCC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-15-tokcast-宇宙的终点不是热死-而是被无限次驾驶回正轨/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cee80eb6567ee2d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:28:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">ToKCast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0815</span></div>\n<h2>宇宙的终点不是热死，而是被无限次驾驶回正轨</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tipler 的 omega point 理论被他自己夸张的宗教主张毁掉了，但 Deutsch 说里面有一个有价值的核心：宇宙必须被持续驾驶，才能在有限时间里完成无限计算。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">宇宙学</span><span class=\"tag\">物理哲学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"361: Bacteria and Colon Cancer Recurrence bowel prep collagenase type IV pilus MAT protein\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-14-thisweekinmicr-大肠癌手术前的抗生素清肠-可能恰好在替促癌细菌做筛选/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0b2f5ae26988f1a6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Microbiology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0814</span></div>\n<h2>大肠癌手术前的抗生素清肠，可能恰好在替促癌细菌做筛选</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大肠癌手术前的抗生素清肠本为预防感染；可复发者肠道里的耐药菌对它无动于衷，手术日细菌总量反而是非复发者的23倍。清肠也许正是在为未来的复发做筛选。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">结直肠癌</span><span class=\"tag\">肠道菌群</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"492 刘怡、于杰谈保罗·沃尔克与现代美联储制度的形成 Triffin dilemma Bancor Eurodollar market Volcker shock\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-14-cn2aa250-美联储不是天生精密-它该干什么到1970年代还在摸索/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0814</span></div>\n<h2>美联储不是天生精密：它该干什么到1970年代还在摸索</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美联储主席在1970年代前连该干什么都说不清，总统直接下令降息保就业。沃尔克把利率推到超过20%硬扛通胀，也立起了「主席只看通胀和失业」的现代模板。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美联储</span><span class=\"tag\">通货膨胀</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Picky Eating &amp; Food Guilt with Jennifer Anderson embodied independence hyper-palatable foods PSAE\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-14-raisinggh-挑食焦虑的解药-不评判-不奖励-甜点也是普通食物/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9372f4ec9923f201-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">46:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0814</span></div>\n<h2>挑食焦虑的解药：不评判，不奖励，甜点也是普通食物</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">孩子与食物的关系不取决于吃没吃某样东西，而在家长是否把食物分成好坏、是否用甜点当奖励、是否允许自己按孩子的真实需要喂养；挑食信号越早识别越容易改变。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">儿童喂养</span><span class=\"tag\">挑食</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Why straight dating feels bleak heteropessimism hopeful pessimism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-14-grayarea-异性恋悲观主义-直女困境的真实与表演/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/94d1e3cbb8f9e58a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">57:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Gray Area</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0814</span></div>\n<h2>直女约会悲观不是矫情，是政治倒退与经济依附</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Sarah Jones 认为，直女对约会男性的尴尬与悲观，既是真实感受也是表演，背后是政治倒退、经济依附与社交媒体强化的复杂现实。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">异性恋悲观主义</span><span class=\"tag\">性别政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"A Historic El Niño Is Coming That Could Cost the World Trillions ENSO Teleconnection RONI Level effect\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-14-oddlots-厄尔尼诺不是短期冲击-而是永久性增长损失/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">55:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0814</span></div>\n<h2>厄尔尼诺不是短期冲击，而是永久性增长损失</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">厄尔尼诺不只是短期天气冲击，研究显示它会永久压低经济增长轨迹，一次强厄尔尼诺五年内可造成数万亿美元损失，且我们并未适应。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">厄尔尼诺</span><span class=\"tag\">气候经济</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Lindy Teammate: Flo Crivello on Multiplayer Agents, Memory &amp; Why He&#x27;d Ban the Chinese Models He Uses hydration context bucket centary tree TOON hypothesis driven retrieval per-user LoRA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-14-cogrev-lindy-全线跑在-deepseek-上-创始人主张封禁中国模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cde4d0762bd9b4a2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:06:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0814</span></div>\n<h2>Lindy 全线跑 DeepSeek，创始人却主张封禁中国模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Flo Crivello 说 Lindy 的 agent 现在整条链路的 driver 就是 DeepSeek，而他同时主张全行业一起被禁——因为竞争对手会用，他就不得不用，宁愿协调解决这个囚徒困境。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">agent 记忆</span><span class=\"tag\">上下文工程</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"SK hynix and the HBM Revolution HBM TSV TC-NCF MR-MUF HBM-PIM ADR\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-asianometry-sk-hynix-靠-hbm-翻身-客户战略赢过周期/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/143ca5977a616036-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>SK hynix 翻身靠的不是 HBM 技术，而是客户关系</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">SK hynix 的翻身不是押中 HBM 技术，而是押中客户关系与长期投入；Samsung 押注 PIM 边缘推理，恰好把 ChatGPT 时刻的唯一供应商位置让给了对手。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">半导体</span><span class=\"tag\">HBM</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Chess.com Teaches US About Superhuman Capabilities, with CEO Erik Allebest Stockfish Leela Chess Zero mittens bot ELO secondary\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-nopriors-ai-让国际象棋变无聊后-又让它更好看了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cdff3faf801808d4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">46:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>AI 让国际象棋变无聊后，又让它更好看了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Stockfish 时代棋手模仿完美引擎，比赛变得沉闷；神经网络引擎下出激进非常规的棋，反而把人类棋力推得更高。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">国际象棋</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 与人类技能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Chelsea Finn: This is the State of the Art in Robotics compositional generalization subgoal image time-to-success RL post-training\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-ycsp-机器人单模型开箱追平微调专才-组合泛化已有强证据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/04a76cf95c327656-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">58:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>机器人单模型开箱打平微调专才，组合泛化已有强证据</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">机器人单模型开箱追平微调专才，尤其能在从未见过的机械臂上组合泛化，这都依赖用提示词驯服低质异构数据；瓶颈正在转向可靠性、速度和物理分发。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">机器人模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"We Solve the 49ers Viral Conspiracy Theory milligauss deep story\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-sciencevs-变电站不背这口锅-49人队伤病阴谋论被拆穿/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3282246c3202bd6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>49人队伤病怪变电站？剂量差40倍，数据也不支持</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">宣称变电站电磁波导致49人队伤病狂潮的阴谋论，被辐射专家和伤病数据库逐条证伪：剂量远低于安全线、引用的论文不合格、2014年扩建的是另一座电站，数据也显示他们并非最惨。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">NFL</span><span class=\"tag\">伤病数据</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Transcranial magnetic stimulation and the future of psychiatry | Corey Keller TMS theta burst stimulation cortical excitability limbic subgenual cingulate\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-fromourneurons-tms-治抑郁只有五成有效-卡在不懂它怎么改变大脑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/372ab8e78a5e10ef-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">46:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">From Our Neurons to Yours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>TMS 治抑郁只有五成有效：卡在不懂它怎么改变大脑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">TMS 已进入临床却还是「黑箱」，机理不清导致疗效停留在 50%。用癫痫病人颅内电极取到神经元的ground truth，下一步是磨出脑电 biomarker，把治疗从猜参数变成闭环优化。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">TMS</span><span class=\"tag\">神经调控</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Bill Bernstein: The Money Decisions That Actually Matter | Rational Reminder 422 hedonic treadmill self-determination theory TIPS ladder hyperscalers Easterlin paradox sinning a little\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-rationalreminder-想给孙辈留财富-范德比尔特家族聚会里没有一个百万富翁/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/473a88561804f746-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>想给孙辈留财富？范德比尔特家族聚会里没有一个百万富翁</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">财富传承几乎注定失败：继承人每代翻倍稀释、缴税、攀比消费；真正该做的是趁孩子三四十岁用「温暖的手」把钱给出去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">财富传承</span><span class=\"tag\">退休规划</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Archive: Coffee Sufis Levant Company Lloyd&#x27;s List Robusta Moka pot espresso\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-inourtime-咖啡因催生了近代商业情报网络与社交空间/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c3f143ddc011b622-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">56:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">In Our Time</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>咖啡不让人醉，反而催生了近代商业情报网络</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">咖啡最早为苏菲派祈祷提供清醒；它不让人醉，反而让人长谈，于是咖啡馆成为商业情报交换所，进而通过奴隶种植园和品牌化重塑全球经济。今天关于拿铁的争论，仍写在这段五百年的历史里。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">咖啡</span><span class=\"tag\">商业史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Essentials: How to Optimize Female Hormone Health for Vitality &amp; Longevity | Dr. Sara Gottfried SHBG CGM PCOS FDG PET HPA axis CAC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-huberman-女性激素真相-睾酮流失与围绝经期脑代谢/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a1ac1c82ed5e5947-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">38:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Huberman Lab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>女性睾酮每年降1%，围绝经期大脑代谢降20%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">女性应在 20 多岁建立激素基线，睾酮每年约降 1%；口服避孕药在降卵巢癌风险的同时可能让阴蒂缩小最多 20%；围绝经期大脑葡萄糖代谢平均降 20%，潮热是疾病信号而非小麻烦。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">女性激素</span><span class=\"tag\">睾酮</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Trucking Is Booming Again, And Drivers Aren&#x27;t Happy About It non-domiciled CDL ELD (electronic logging device) freight broker FMCSA safety rating spot vs contract rate owner operator\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-oddlots-这轮卡车运价上涨来自供给被砍-不是需求回来了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">46:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>卡车运价暴涨不是需求回来了，是供给被执法砍掉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英语能力执法、non-domiciled CDL 收紧和最高法院经纪商责任判决同时抽走运力，把三年低谷终结的不是货量回升，而是入行门槛被结构性抬高——下一次需求爆发时市场已无法像 COVID 那样迅速补供给。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">卡车运输</span><span class=\"tag\">监管</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The blatant betrayal that erased the Tupperware queen from history subversive domesticity burp Wonder Bowl Jubilee\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-throughline-特百惠女王遭公然背叛-被美国历史抹去/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6899c998b8f2c10a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">49:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>特百惠女王被解雇后，公司埋掉了她的书</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Brownie Wise 用「家庭主妇聚会」把特百惠变成美国国民品牌，却因名气盖过发明家而被解雇、销毁生平记录，直到 2016 年公园命名才被官方承认。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">销售革命</span><span class=\"tag\">女性职场</span>\n</div></div></a>"]